name: cloudflare
version: 0.2.0
description: Custom Salt modules for managing Cloudflare DNS zones and records

# --- Salt compatibility ---
minimum_version: 3006
maximum_version: 3009

python_requires:
  - name: requests
    version: ">=2.28.0"


dependencies: []

maintainers:
  - name: SomeBlackMagic
    email: dev@someblackmagic.com
    github: SomeBlackMagic

authors:
  - name: SomeBlackMagic

license: MIT

website: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-cloudflare-formula
source: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-cloudflare-formula
issues: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-cloudflare-formula/issues

summary: |
  Provides custom Salt state and execution modules for Cloudflare DNS:
    - cloudflare (execution) — API wrapper for zones and DNS records
    - cloudflare (state)     — declarative DNS records management via manage_zone_records
